  {
    "id": 6902001070010,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "お前、担当アイドルのことをどう思っている？",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/600600107/6902001070010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……たしかに負けてしまいましたけど、\r\n彼女こそが最高のアイドルだと思っています",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6902001070020,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "……！　そうか……",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/600600107/6902001070020"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001070010,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ふふ\r\n社長が聞きたかった言葉、そのまま出てきましたね",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/600600107/6901001070010"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001070020,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "もし違う言葉が出てきたら、\r\n説教してやるって言って聞かなかったのに",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/600600107/6901001070020"
  },
  {
    "id": 6902001070030,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "……うるさいぞ。とにかく、\r\nそういうことなら私から言うことはない",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/600600107/6902001070030"
  },
  {
    "id": 6902001070040,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "さあ、早くその最高のアイドルに\r\n会いに行ってこい",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/600600107/6902001070040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……はい！",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
