    "voice": "produce_events/600600107/6006001070010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんだ、また改まって？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6006001070020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "改まって、のつもりはないんだけどね\r\nずっと思っていたことだよ",
    "charAnim2": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charAnim2Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600600107/6006001070020"
  },
  {
    "id": 6006001070030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アイドルにスカウトしてくれたこと\r\nプロデューサーには感謝してるんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600600107/6006001070030"
  },
  {
    "id": 6006001070040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "おかげでたくさんの人の笑顔を見ることができたよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600600107/6006001070040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか。面と向かっていわれると、なんだかこそばゆいな\r\nでも、咲耶はまだこれからだろ？",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6006001070050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そうだね、わかっているよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600600107/6006001070050"
  },
  {
    "id": 6006001070060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "優勝はできなかったけど、また、一から自分を磨いて\r\nみんなをもっと笑顔にできるようにがんばるよ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600600107/6006001070060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
